      <activity id="feaed139-065b-5238-8d92-8aafe3e74759" activityNameId="2c517725-effa-5ce2-97df-0f82ab1fd612" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Glazing, double (2-IV), U&lt;1.1 W/m2K, laminated safety glass, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Glazing, double (2-IV), U&lt;1.1 W/m2K, laminated safety glass, at plant
This dataset describes the processes included in the production of 1.06m2 (corresponding to 1m2 visible area) double glazing (2-IV, LSG) with a U-value below 1.1 W/m2K. It can be applied for laminated safety double glazing used in the building sector. 1 m2 visible glazing area has a final weight of 26 kg.;
UUID: b510d811-7fb0-319d-b74f-954526aa999f
Included in this dataset are the materials and production processes of 1.06m2 (corresponding to 1m2 visible area) LSG double glazing (2-IV, LSG) with a U-value below 1.1 W/m2K including disposal of waste water and production wastes.
Location: Data estimated according to a European company.
Technology: The technology represents average European production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company documentation, calculations based on geometry 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this dataset is representative for the whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b510d811-7fb0-319d-b74f-954526aa999f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
